- البرز- شهرک صنعتی بهارستان- گلستان ششم غربی- پلاک153.</p>\n<p><strong>وبسایت</strong><strong> </strong><a href=\"https://parsianpharma.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://parsianpharma.com</a> </p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8967f09 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"8967f09\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e9a7be8\" data-id=\"e9a7be8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f82e973 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f82e973\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">محصول تولیدی\n</h5>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b6c88d elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"7b6c88d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-2f17195 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2f17195\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\